      'Darkforme Salachleon': 'Salachleons belong in Elzbereth and Dimspark because they turn magma channels, smolder-cores, and furnace shadows into stalking ground for a true deep-fire predator.',
      'Darkling Fire-Dracklie': 'Fire-Dracklies give Dimspark a signature chaotic fauna, making the foundries and slag heaps feel inhabited by something dangerous, noisy, and weirdly local.',
      'Darkforged-Slag-Brute': 'Slag-Brutes are a direct fit for Elzbereth\'s forge-heavy identity, reading like failed industrial labor given monstrous persistence in the hottest and dirtiest works.',
      'Darkling-Grease-Mite': 'Grease-Mites make immediate sense in Elzbereth because a city of rails, engines, joints, and pipes should have its own sabotage vermin living in the machine seams.',
      'Darkling-Petro-Legion': 'The Petro-Legion fits the lower industrial and magma-adjacent zones, especially where Dimspark and the rougher forge districts convert runoff, residue, and fuel-body hazards into living threats.',
